## M3 forwarding constraints

Active core: s1. Baseline paths: s3/s4/s5/s6 → s1.

Do **not** use in normal baseline forwarding: s2 alternate uplinks; s1–s2; s3–s4; h6–s6 secondary. Those links stay physically present for controlled experiments/failover.

Baseline must remain deterministic and loop-free. Do **not** enable OVS NORMAL, STP, `org.onosproject.fwd`, or uncontrolled L2 flooding to make `pingall` succeed.

